37.864">And </span><span begin="00:37.864" end="00:38.083">you </span><span begin="00:38.083" end="00:39.667">say </span><span begin="00:40.428" end="00:40.655">you </span><span begin="00:40.655" end="00:40.914">were </span><span begin="00:40.914" end="00:42.834">busy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.079" end="00:49.472"><span begin="00:43.079" end="00:43.269">But </span><span begin="00:43.269" end="00:43.592">you've </span><span begin="00:43.592" end="00:45.328">never </span><span begin="00:45.328" end="00:45.739">not </span><span begin="00:45.739" end="00:46.337">made </span><span begin="00:46.337" end="00:47.205">time </span><span begin="00:47.205" end="00:47.857">for </span><span begin="00:47.857" end="00:49.472">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.535" end="01:00.817"><span begin="00:55.535" end="00:55.797">Why </span><span begin="00:55.797" end="00:56.004">do </span><span begin="00:56.004" end="00:56.192">you </span><span begin="00:56.192" end="00:56.861">lie </span><span begin="00:56.861" end="00:57.667">when </span><span begin="00:57.667" end="00:58.000">there's </span><span begin="00:58.000" end="00:58.274">no </span><span begin="00:58.274" end="00:59.079">point </span><span begin="00:59.079" end="00:59.390">in </span><span begin="00:59.390" end="01:00.817">lying?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.528" end="01:11.782"><span begin="01:06.528" end="01:06.837">Why </span><span begin="01:06.837" end="01:07.091">do </span><span begin="01:07.091" end="01:07.316">I </span><span begin="01:07.316" end="01:07.890">try </span><span begin="01:07.890" end="01:08.508">when </span><span begin="01:08.508" end="01:09.016">there's </span><span begin="01:09.016" end="01:09.373">no </span><span begin="01:09.373" end="01:09.906">point </span><span begin="01:09.906" end="01:10.165">in </span><span begin="01:10.165" end="01:11.782">trying?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.000" end="01:17.526"><span begin="01:12.000" end="01:12.226">You </span><span 