 end="01:35.892">the </span><span begin="01:35.892" end="01:36.924">thought </span><span begin="01:36.924" end="01:37.295">of </span><span begin="01:37.295" end="01:38.301">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.495" end="01:44.900"><span begin="01:38.495" end="01:38.742">With </span><span begin="01:38.742" end="01:40.062">someone </span><span begin="01:40.062" end="01:41.028">else </span><span begin="01:41.276" end="01:41.504">I </span><span begin="01:41.504" end="01:42.567">know </span><span begin="01:42.567" end="01:42.946">the </span><span begin="01:42.946" end="01:44.900">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.898" end="01:55.963"><span begin="01:50.898" end="01:51.140">Why </span><span begin="01:51.140" end="01:51.413">do </span><span begin="01:51.413" end="01:51.662">you </span><span begin="01:51.662" end="01:52.372">lie </span><span begin="01:52.372" end="01:52.930">when </span><span begin="01:52.930" end="01:53.245">there's </span><span begin="01:53.245" end="01:53.574">no </span><span begin="01:53.574" end="01:54.214">point </span><span begin="01:54.214" end="01:54.500">in </span><span begin="01:54.500" end="01:55.963">lying?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.708" end="02:06.896"><span begin="02:01.708" end="02:02.034">Why </span><span begin="02:02.034" end="02:02.244">do </span><span begin="02:02.244" end="02:02.453">I </span><span begin="02:02.453" end="02:03.236">try </span><span begin="02:03.236" end="02:03.915">when </span><span begin="02:03.915" end="02:04.281">there's </span><span begin="02:04.281" end="02:04.649">no </span><span begin="02:04.649" end="02:04.999">point </span><span begin="02:04.999" end="02:05.497">in </span><span begin="02:05.497" end="02:06.896">trying?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.160" end="02:12.759"><span begin="02:07.160" end="02:07.428">You </span><span begin="02:07.428" end="02:08.124">loved </span><span begin="02:08.124" end="02:08.711">me </span><span begin="02:08.711" end="02:09.093">at </